+ * doing, rather than the tool's own name and its arguments.
+ *
+ * Two kinds of line reach it. One is the bot's own note about what it is up to, and the bot writes
+ * that in the reader's own words, so it is shown as written. The other is the server's record of
+ * the call being made, which is a tool's name and what it was given — `Read file
