+ * command. Those say what a tool was handed, not what the bot is telling the reader, so the line
+ * says 正在读文件 rather than a path: every name the server can write has its phrase below, and a
+ * line that is plainly a command is said as one. A line with no Chinese in it is never one of the
+ * bot's own notes, so it is never shown as written either.
